---
import AsterLayout from "../../layouts/AsterLayout.astro";
import { ASTER_DEX_ID, AUTHORS, PERSON_ID, SITE_URL } from "../../entity";
import { buildAsterPageGraph, buildBreadcrumbs } from "../../lib/schema";
import { ASTER_DOCS, ASTER_LAST_VERIFIED, ASTER_MAX_SUPPLY, ASTER_TOKEN_ADDRESS, ASTER_TOKEN_STANDARD, ASTER_TOKENOMICS } from "../../data/aster";

const url = `${SITE_URL}/aster-dex/tokenomics/`;
const description =
  "ASTER tokenomics: the 8 billion supply, allocation and vesting, the 99% fee buyback, bi-weekly burns to a 3 billion floor, and veASTER distribution.";

const articleNode = {
  "@type": "TechArticle",
  "@id": `${url}#article`,
  headline: "ASTER tokenomics",
  alternativeHeadline: "ASTER tokenomics and the buyback mechanism",
  name: "ASTER tokenomics and the buyback mechanism",
  description,
  url,
  mainEntityOfPage: url,
  inLanguage: "en",
  datePublished: "2026-11-24",
  dateModified: ASTER_LAST_VERIFIED,
  author: { "@id": AUTHORS.kirsty.id },
  editor: { "@id": AUTHORS.maksim.id },
  publisher: { "@id": PERSON_ID },
  isPartOf: { "@id": `${SITE_URL}/aster-dex/#collection` },
  articleSection: "Token",
  about: [
    { "@id": ASTER_DEX_ID },
    { "@type": "Thing", name: "Tokenomics" },
    { "@type": "Thing", name: "Cryptocurrency token" },
  ],
  citation: [
    { "@type": "CreativeWork", name: "ASTER token overview", url: `${ASTER_DOCS}usdaster-token/overview` },
    { "@type": "CreativeWork", name: "Tokenomics", url: `${ASTER_DOCS}usdaster-token/tokenomics` },
  ],
};

const breadcrumbs = buildBreadcrumbs(`${url}#breadcrumbs`, [
  { name: "Home", url: `${SITE_URL}/` },
  { name: "Aster DEX", url: `${SITE_URL}/aster-dex/` },
  { name: "Tokenomics", url },
]);

const graph = buildAsterPageGraph([articleNode, breadcrumbs]);
---

<AsterLayout
  title="ASTER Tokenomics — Allocation, Buyback and Burns | Maksim Sokal"
  description={description}
  canonical={url}
  graph={graph}
  trail={[{ label: "Tokenomics" }]}
  modified={new Date(ASTER_LAST_VERIFIED)}
>
  <header class="space-y-5 max-w-3xl">
    <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400 uppercase tracking-widest block">Token</span>
    <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-4xl text-slate-100 tracking-tight leading-tight">
      ASTER tokenomics
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      ASTER is the network, governance and reward asset. The design has two moving parts worth understanding: a large
      community allocation with a long tail of unlocks, and a fee-funded buyback that distributes to locked stakers while
      burning from reserve.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">
      Verified <time datetime={ASTER_LAST_VERIFIED}>{ASTER_LAST_VERIFIED}</time> ·{" "}
      <a href={`${ASTER_DOCS}usdaster-token/tokenomics`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">official tokenomics</a>
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3" aria-label="Token facts">
    <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
      <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">Max supply</span>
      <span class="text-sm text-slate-100">{ASTER_MAX_SUPPLY}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
      <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">Standard</span>
      <span class="text-sm text-slate-100">{ASTER_TOKEN_STANDARD}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1 sm:col-span-1">
      <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">Contract</span>
      <code class="block text-[10px] text-slate-200 break-all">{ASTER_TOKEN_ADDRESS}</code>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="allocation-heading">
    <h2 id="allocation-heading" class="font-display font-medium text-xl text-slate-100 tracking-tight">Allocation</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-[#1e293b]/60">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-brand-950/60 border-b border-[#1e293b]/40">
            <th scope="col" class="text-left text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Category</th>
            <th scope="col" class="text-left text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Share</th>
            <th scope="col" class="text-left text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Tokens</th>
            <th scope="col" class="text-left text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-5 py-3 font-semibold">Note</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {ASTER_TOKENOMICS.map((row) => (
            <tr class="border-b border-[#1e293b]/30 last:border-b-0">
              <td class="px-5 py-4 text-xs text-slate-200">{row.category}</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-4 text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono">{row.share}</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-4 text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono">{row.amount}</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-4 text-xs text-slate-400">{row.note}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
      The team allocation (5%) remains locked under an extended cliff. The docs describe a 40-month linear vesting
      schedule at 10,000,000 ASTER per month after unlock; confirm the current schedule before relying on a specific
      date.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="buyback-heading">
    <h2 id="buyback-heading" class="font-display font-medium text-xl text-slate-100 tracking-tight">The buyback and burn loop</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-display text-sm text-slate-100">1. Fees</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">99% of daily platform fees are routed to a buyback wallet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-display text-sm text-slate-100">2. Buyback</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">A TWAP executes across the day and settles onchain. Bought ASTER goes to veASTER stakers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-display text-sm text-slate-100">3. Burn</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">An equal amount is burned from reserve, team allocation first, bi-weekly, until supply reaches 3 billion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      Permissionless spot listings also feed the loop: each listing costs 50,000 USDT, collected weekly and used to buy
      back ASTER.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3" aria-labelledby="meaning-heading">
    <h2 id="meaning-heading" class="font-display font-medium text-xl text-slate-100 tracking-tight">What this does and does not mean</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-5">
        <h3 class="font-display text-sm text-emerald-300 mb-2">Mechanically</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Fee revenue creates buy pressure and a matching burn.</li>
          <li>Stakers who lock longer capture more of the buyback.</li>
          <li>The 3 billion floor is a hard supply target.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-brand-900/35 border border-[#1e293b]/60 rounded-xl p-5">
        <h3 class="font-display text-sm text-rose-300 mb-2">Not guaranteed</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Buyback size depends on trading volume, which falls in quiet markets.</li>
          <li>Burns reduce supply but do not determine price.</li>
          <li>Unlocks and emissions can offset the effect.</li>
          <li>Nothing here is a price prediction or investment advice.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-[#1e293b]/60 pt-6 space-y-2">
    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
      Related: <a href="/aster-dex/staking/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">staking and veASTER</a> ·
      <a href="/aster-dex/fees/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">fee schedule</a> ·
      <a href="/aster-dex/contracts/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">token contract</a>
    </p>
    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
      Written by <a href="/kirsty-moreland/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">Kirsty Moreland</a> · Technical review by{" "}
      <a href="/about/" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">Maksim Sokal</a> ·
      <a href="/disclosure/" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-sky-300">Disclosure</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</AsterLayout>
